# Keep every text file LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows' default `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites the whole checkout to CRLF,
# and `npm run lint` then fails with one `prettier/prettier: Delete ␍` error per line — thousands of
# them — before a Windows contributor has changed anything. Prettier formats with LF (its default),
# so the repo has to check out that way too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.vsix binary
